          "widget": {
            "name": "30e9d3d69880",
            "textbox_spec": "### How to read these metrics\n- **Coverage:** delivered orders with items accepted by the project's quality rules. Rejected rows are retained in Bronze and quarantine tables.\n- **On time:** delivery date on or before the promised date; orders without a valid assessment are excluded from the rate denominator.\n- **Period:** purchase month. Historical data from 2016–2018; the first and last months may be partial. Start with the full date range and all states.\n- **Source:** Olist · Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset · CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."
          }
        }
